---
import Mark from "../product/Mark.astro"
import Section from "../site/Section.astro"
import SectionHead from "../site/SectionHead.astro"

const check = '<path d="m5 12 5 5 9-10"/>'
const chevron = '<path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/>'

const steps = [
  { phase: "Checking queries", message: "Checked a query on prom: 0 errors" },
  { phase: "Running queries", message: "Ran a query on prom: 4 series" },
  { phase: "Saving", message: "Saved version 7 (3 rows, 13 panels)" },
]
---

<Section ruled={false}>
  <SectionHead
    title="People and agents work under the same rules."
    lead="Observe Agent, Claude Code and other MCP clients show up by name, and what they change is on the record."
  />
  <div class="lined lined-3">
    <div class="rule">
      <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="row"><Mark kind="person" initials="AD" tint={1} size={20} /><b>admin</b></span>
        <span class="row"><Mark kind="agent" size={20} /><b>Observe Agent for admin</b></span>
        <span class="row"><Mark kind="connected" initials="CC" size={20} /><b>admin (via Claude Code)</b></span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="h4">Everything has an author.</h3>
      <p class="p">
        Every change to a dashboard or an observation is recorded with who made it. People are tinted marks, Observe
        Agent is the filled one and outside agents are outlined. A change made through an agent names both sides.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rule">
      <ol class="art steps" aria-hidden="true">
        {
          steps.map(({ phase, message }) => (
            <li class="row">
              <svg class="ok" viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={check} />
              <span>{phase} <span class="k">{message}</span></span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
      <h3 class="h4">Every new or changed query runs before it is saved.</h3>
      <p class="p">
        The server runs each query a save adds or changes before it stores a version, whether the agent, the web app, the
        CLI or an MCP client saves. A panel whose query fails or returns no data is rejected by name, and the agent fixes
        only those.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rule">
      <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="row">
          <Mark kind="connected" initials="OP" size={20} />
          <b>OpenCode</b>
          <span class="btn btn-sm mode">Propose <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" set:html={chevron} /></span>
        </span>
        <span class="row"><span class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Merge</span><span class="btn btn-sm">Discard</span></span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="h4">Agents can propose. People decide.</h3>
      <p class="p">
        Each connected agent saves directly or proposes. A proposal lists what it changes and waits until a person who
        can edit merges or discards it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .rule {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .art {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 112px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .row {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .row b {
    font-weight: 600;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .ok {
    flex: none;
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--ok);
    stroke-width: 2.4;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .mode {
    min-height: 28px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .mode svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .art .btn {
    min-height: 28px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }

  .h4 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>
